c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRiPb81SawfgZNTZa9bs2-GUqATtOxrwGJBRHCCLIzSog&oe=6B0DC91E"}, "display_name": "Sortik Systems", "keywords": ["puzzle", "logic", "reflexes", "arcade", "control"], "long_description": "..                                                                                                                                                                                                     \n                                                                                           \n{2084111539021823}\n{2067151657099937}\n{8774944532609238}\n{1008662428038318}\n{1349487829462552}\n{644542485408570}\n\nVoice acting in English and Spanish.\t\t\n\t\n# Accessibility\n\n- Colorblind-friendly design with texture-based coding system.\n\n- Full one-handed play (controllers/hand tracking).\n\n- Comfort settings for seated play.\n\n**Your opinion matters!** If you have suggestions or feedback, feel free to reach out on Discord:\nhttps://discord.pamp.es/\n\nThank you for being part of **Sortik Systems\u2019** evolution.\n\n\u2013 Alex Pamp\n", "short_description": "Today is your first day at Sortik Systems, the megacorporation that promises absolute order but hides a dark secret.\n\nHow far will you go to maintain order?\n\nYour job is to sort objects by color and attributes. But in between, messages start appearing... warnings... Who is sending them?\nBe careful. The corporation is watching you.\n\nAre you ready to prove yourself in a system that tolerates no mistakes?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://games.pamp.es/sortik-systems/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pamp Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://games.pamp.es/sortik-systems/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978